# Test has-cap? on a file handle (has-cap? is now in stdlib/io.llt)
# open returns a handle with Readable and Text caps
[include %libdir "io.llt"]
[has-cap? [open %cwd "Cargo.toml" Readable] "Readable"]
=== out
Bool(true)

=== warn
[UnificationFailure] cannot unify Handle[WriteHandle] with Handle[[__cap_flag_readable: []]]
